  "details": "I apologize if this text is difficult to read due to the use of a translation application. -This is a question about the avatar error when starting the creation world in offline test mode.\n\n_____________________________________________________________________________________________\n\nThis is a report about avatar errors when launching a created world in offline test mode.\n\nWhen launching a world in offline test mode, all avatars are in an error state.\n\n　　→The gimmick using the Station cannot sit on the chair and does not work properly.\n\nThe above phenomenon did not occur until yesterday around mid-morning.\n\nAll avatars can be used in online mode.\n\nThe same problem occurs in both Unity 2022.3.22f1 and 2022.3.6f1.\n\nThe problem was confirmed in SDK 3.7.4, 3.7.5, and 3.7.6.\n\n- reproduction procedure -\n\n1.   Click “Build & Test Your World” to start any world.\n\n2.  Confirm your avatar in the launched world.\n\n- Temporary solution -\n\nBuild a test avatar, and switch to the test avatar after entering a world launched in offline test mode.",
